1. -- { Welcome to the Basic Test of 100 Endgames You Must Know! We've had some users pointing out the difficulty of the Basic Test, so let's start with a short introduction. Going through the Basic Test gives you an indication of the endgames you have not yet mastered. See it as a tool to help you prioritize your studying within the course and find out what endgames you might want to put some extra focus on. Please do not be discouraged by the level of difficulty you run into here! Most of the material covered in the course is far less challenging than the test. It is also perfectly possible to first skip the Basic Test and return to it later. Good luck! - The Chessable Team } 
 *

