 { White to move. Suppose you have already spent 30 of your 50 moves to get here. It is time to be accurate. What would you do ? } 1. { -KEY- } Nd7 $1 { Also winning in less than 20 moves are the moves Bc2 and Kd5; but the text move is pure tactics. } Kc6 ( 1... Kb7 2. Bd3 ) 
2. Bd3 { Closing off the way out. } Kc7 3. Bb5 $1 Kd8 4. Nf6 Kc7 5. Nd5+ { Building the cage. } Kd8 6. Kd6 Kc8 7. Ke7 Kb7 8. Kd7 Kb8 9. Ba6 Ka7 10. Bc8 Kb8 11. Nb4 Ka7 12. Kc7 Ka8 13. Bb7+ Ka7 14. Nc6# { Mate. See Ending 93. } 
 1-0

